<title>FINLAND: LASSILA UP SHARPLY ON 96 REPORT, DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>LASSILA UP SHARPLY ON 96 REPORT, DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish plastic and cleaning equipment maker Lassila &amp; Tikanoja Oy rose sharply on Wednesday after a strong 1996 report but trade was modest, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1320/1120 GMT, Lassila &amp; Tikanoja traded at 360.00 markka, up 32.00 markka or almost ten percent, after hitting a 377.20 life-high. Trade was a modest one million markka.</p>
<p>Lassila earlier reported a 154 million markka profit before extraordinary items and tax, up from 109 million in 1995, and the group doubled its dividend to 13.00 markka.</p>
<p>&quot;Both earnings and the dividend were higher than expected,&quot; one broker said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
</text>
